    and street centrelines.

----------------------------------------------------------------------
How this was made
----------------------------------------------------------------------

The author designed and directed the project and reviewed and accepted
the code, documents and results. Language models (Anthropic Claude
models, run through Claude Code; exact versions were not recorded)
drafted most of the code and documentation, did the imagery ratings, and
diagnosed the routes and bridges. Every agreement statistic (kappa)
quoted in this repository is agreement between model instances. No
person rated imagery, and nothing was checked on the ground. Tools
(axe-core, pa11y, python-osw-validation, the test suite) checked the
rest. Language models did not generate or modify the source data. The
protocols and ratings are in evaluation/.
